WEBVTT

00:02:00.074 --> 00:02:03.786
However, it doesn’t mean
that the continent has escaped unscathed.

00:02:04.412 --> 00:02:07.707
The public health burden
of COVID-19 is only half the story.

00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:10.877
We cannot ignore the indirect harms

00:02:10.877 --> 00:02:13.379
that have been caused
by the lockdown policy --

00:02:13.379 --> 00:02:16.799
a policy that has
disproportionately affected Africa

00:02:16.799 --> 00:02:20.928
because it did not speak to our strengths
or to our circumstances.

00:02:21.804 --> 00:02:25.474
Lockdown stopped
childhood vaccination programs,

00:02:25.474 --> 00:02:27.518
which protect African children

00:02:27.518 --> 00:02:30.730
against diseases far much more
deadly to them than COVID-19.